		<!-- ** Required ** Do not change <id> or <type> (Lyrics, will autoscroll if lrc based lyrics are shown) -->
		<!-- kept invisible on purpose - gui.py's getControl(110)/selectItem()/addItem() still need a
		     real list control to track "current line" against the LRC timestamps, but per user
		     request this dialog shows ONLY that one current line (no scrolling list of surrounding
		     lines, no background box behind it - matching Aeon Nox 5's own plain colored-text style),
		     so nothing about this list is ever actually rendered. See the current-line labels below,
		     which read Container(110)/(112).ListItem.Label - that infolabel reflects the selected
		     item regardless of whether the control has real focus or is even visible. -->
